{"title": "Sting The Helpless", "pageid": 25066, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Sting_The_Helpless", "categories": ["Passive item features", "Passive features"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\">\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\">\n<p><b>Sting The Helpless</b> is a passive feature that allows a creature to inflict additional poison damage to a restrained enemy.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Description\"> Description </span></h2>\n<p>A <a href=\"/wiki/Drow\" title=\"Drow\">Drow</a> wielding this weapon deals an additional <span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-poison\">1d4</span>⁠<span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Poison\" title=\"Poison\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/5/55/Poison_Damage_Icon.png/20px-Poison_Damage_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/5/55/Poison_Damage_Icon.png/30px-Poison_Damage_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/5/55/Poison_Damage_Icon.png/40px-Poison_Damage_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Poison\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/5/55/Poison_Damage_Icon.png/20px-Poison_Damage_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/5/55/Poison_Damage_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span>⁠<a href=\"/wiki/Poison\" title=\"Poison\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-poison\">Poison</span></a> against <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Restrained_(Condition)\" title=\"Restrained (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/2/20/Restrained_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Restrained_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/2/20/Restrained_Condition_Icon.webp/38px-Restrained_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/2/20/Restrained_Condition_Icon.webp/50px-Restrained_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Restrained\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/2/20/Restrained_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Restrained_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/2/20/Restrained_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Restrained_(Condition)\" title=\"Restrained (Condition)\">Restrained</a> targets. \n</p>\n<div style=\"clear: both;\"></div>\n</div> \n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"How_to_learn\"> How to learn </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<p>Granted by the weapons:</p><ul style=\"list-style: none;\">\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 6px\"><span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-rare\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Cruel_Sting\" title=\"Cruel Sting\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/6/6e/Longsword_%2B1_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Longsword_%2B1_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/6/6e/Longsword_%2B1_Unfaded_Icon.png/45px-Longsword_%2B1_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/6/6e/Longsword_%2B1_Unfaded_Icon.png/60px-Longsword_%2B1_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/6/6e/Longsword_%2B1_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Longsword_%2B1_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/6/6e/Longsword_%2B1_Unfaded_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Cruel_Sting\" title=\"Cruel Sting\">Cruel Sting</a></span></li>\n</ul>\n<p>Used by creatures:</p><ul style=\"list-style-type: none\"><li><a href=\"/wiki/Kar%27niss\" title=\"Kar'niss\">Kar'niss</a></li></ul>\n</div> <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Notes\"> Notes </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip\">\n<ul><li>Being <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Disguise_Self\" title=\"Disguise Self\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/8/8d/Disguise_Self_Icon.webp/20px-Disguise_Self_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/8/8d/Disguise_Self_Icon.webp/30px-Disguise_Self_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/8/8d/Disguise_Self_Icon.webp/40px-Disguise_Self_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"disguised\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/8/8d/Disguise_Self_Icon.webp/20px-Disguise_Self_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/8/8d/Disguise_Self_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Disguise_Self\" title=\"Disguise Self\">disguised</a> as a Drow when equipping a weapon with Sting The Helpless also activates the effect.</li>\n<li>Sting The Helpless deals extra poison damage to a creature under any condition in the <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Restrained_(Condition)\" title=\"Restrained (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/2/20/Restrained_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Restrained_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/2/20/Restrained_Condition_Icon.webp/38px-Restrained_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/2/20/Restrained_Condition_Icon.webp/50px-Restrained_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Restrained\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/2/20/Restrained_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Restrained_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/2/20/Restrained_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Restrained_(Condition)\" title=\"Restrained (Condition)\">Restrained</a> status group, which includes (but is not limited to):\n<ul><li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Black_Tentacles_(Condition)\" title=\"Black Tentacles (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/3/39/Black_Tentacles_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Black_Tentacles_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/3/39/Black_Tentacles_Condition_Icon.webp/38px-Black_Tentacles_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/3/39/Black_Tentacles_Condition_Icon.webp/50px-Black_Tentacles_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Black Tentacles\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/3/39/Black_Tentacles_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Black_Tentacles_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/3/39/Black_Tentacles_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Black_Tentacles_(Condition)\" title=\"Black Tentacles (Condition)\">Black Tentacles</a>, via <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Evard%27s_Black_Tentacles\" title=\"Evard's Black Tentacles\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/d/d6/Evard%27s_Black_Tentacles_Icon.webp/20px-Evard%27s_Black_Tentacles_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/d/d6/Evard%27s_Black_Tentacles_Icon.webp/30px-Evard%27s_Black_Tentacles_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/d/d6/Evard%27s_Black_Tentacles_Icon.webp/40px-Evard%27s_Black_Tentacles_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Evard's Black Tentacles\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/d/d6/Evard%27s_Black_Tentacles_Icon.webp/20px-Evard%27s_Black_Tentacles_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/d/d6/Evard%27s_Black_Tentacles_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Evard%27s_Black_Tentacles\" title=\"Evard's Black Tentacles\">Evard's Black Tentacles</a></li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Ensnared_(Ensnaring_Strike)_(Condition)\" title=\"Ensnared (Ensnaring Strike) (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/1/1e/Ensnaring_Strike_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Ensnaring_Strike_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/1/1e/Ensnaring_Strike_Condition_Icon.webp/38px-Ensnaring_Strike_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/1/1e/Ensnaring_Strike_Condition_Icon.webp/50px-Ensnaring_Strike_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Ensnared\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/1/1e/Ensnaring_Strike_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Ensnaring_Strike_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/1/1e/Ensnaring_Strike_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Ensnared_(Ensnaring_Strike)_(Condition)\" title=\"Ensnared (Ensnaring Strike) (Condition)\">Ensnared</a>, via <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Ensnaring_Strike\" title=\"Ensnaring Strike\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/6/60/Ensnaring_Strike_Ranged_Icon.webp/20px-Ensnaring_Strike_Ranged_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/6/60/Ensnaring_Strike_Ranged_Icon.webp/30px-Ensnaring_Strike_Ranged_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/6/60/Ensnaring_Strike_Ranged_Icon.webp/40px-Ensnaring_Strike_Ranged_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Ensnaring Strike\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/6/60/Ensnaring_Strike_Ranged_Icon.webp/20px-Ensnaring_Strike_Ranged_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/6/60/Ensnaring_Strike_Ranged_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a><